NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY DATA

This project integrates data from several third-party sources, each governed
by its own license and attribution requirements:

  - MIDB 5.0 (Correlates of War / Gibler & Miller) - research use, citation required
  - UCDP Dyadic v26.1 (Uppsala Conflict Data Program) - CC-BY 4.0
  - UCDP/PRIO Armed Conflict v26.1 - CC-BY 4.0
  - EUSANCT Dataset (Hufbauer et al.) - research use, citation required
  - CShapes 2.0 (Weidmann, Rød & Ketterer) - CC-BY 4.0
  - V-Dem Core v16 (Varieties of Democracy Institute) - CC-BY 4.0
  - NMC v7 (Correlates of War, Singer) - research use, citation required
  - ATOP 3.0 (Leeds et al.) - research use, citation required

Users are responsible for complying with the licensing terms of each source
dataset. The license above covers only the source code in this repository.
